Build passed.

**What was failing:** When searching stdin without `-H`, the code incorrectly added `(standard input):` prefix to all output lines. The spec requires no prefix for stdin unless `-H` is explicitly given.

**What changed:** Modified the stdin search loop (lines 168-187) to check `force_filename` before deciding whether to use `write_line_with_prefix()` or `write_line()`.

**Build command:** `mkdir -p build && cc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic -O2 src/new_grep/new_grep.c -o build/new_grep`

